+### Model menu account selection
+
+Register `client.addModelAccountSource?.({ read, select, cancel })` when your plugin owns account selection for existing conversations. Return `null` from `read(agentId)` for agents outside your pool. The model menu reads the source on its own host while open. Use the account that confirmed the thread for `current` and the provider that created it for `origin`. Keep an unconfirmed destination in `pending`. Model choices and saved profiles use the original provider.
+
+Resolve `select` after the daemon accepts the choice. When the agent is busy, persist the selection and allow `cancel` until switching starts. A client can close or reconnect before the turn finishes. Return `canSwitch: false` and a reason when the host can only display the current account.
